    (`Sch 2 para 6(1) — the owners or directors of the company include a listed person` (facts's `the creditor as a possible company`))
    AND (    ((facts's `kind of payment`) EQUALS `rent payments`)
          OR (    ((facts's `kind of payment`) EQUALS `service charge payments`)
